# deployments/ is TRACKED on purpose.
#
# It holds the addresses a judge verifies against and the measured HCU from the
# live draw. Ignoring it meant the two numbers this submission rests on existed
# only on my machine, and a claim in the README that nothing in the repository
# can support is worth nothing. There are no keys in these files, only
# addresses, gas and block numbers, all of which are public the moment the
# transaction lands.

# Unrelated to Sortis. Tooling and reference material for other work that
# happens to share this working directory.
