# Design reference captures. Third-party screenshots, not ours to redistribute.
refs/

# Build briefs and prompts. Working documents rather than product, and they
# carry scheduling, unrelated project names, and design influence expressed as
# percentages. None of it is a credential and none of it belongs in a public
# repository a judge is reading.
docs/BRIEF.md
docs/SORTIS-BRIEF-V2.md
docs/SORTIS-FINAL-PROMPT.md

# The design reference harness. It names seven third-party products and exists
